[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9420.95, "timestamp": "02:37:00", "text": "发生。等等，为什么我感觉自己好像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9427.19, "timestamp": "02:37:07", "text": "等等，为什么我感觉自己好像在说话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9429.75, "timestamp": "02:37:09", "text": "像天使一样？她那些想法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9432.63, "timestamp": "02:37:12", "text": "刚才我才反应过来，我的天，太像了。哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9435.83, "timestamp": "02:37:15", "text": "天哪，太像了。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9438.63, "timestamp": "02:37:18", "text": "是的，某种程度上有点类似。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9442.87, "timestamp": "02:37:22", "text": "是的，我需要想办法解决这个问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9446.309, "timestamp": "02:37:26", "text": "不，我希望我手里拿着一个桃子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9454.87, "timestamp": "02:37:34", "text": "那应该不错吧？某种程度上来说。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9461.03, "timestamp": "02:37:41", "text": "但是，是的，但在某种程度上……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9463.03, "timestamp": "02:37:43", "text": "呃，这种情况尤其发生在我明知它存在的时候。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9464.79, "timestamp": "02:37:44", "text": "好像每个人都在10点以后给你打电话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9468.55, "timestamp": "02:37:48", "text": "分钟。是的，这种情况经常发生。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9470.95, "timestamp": "02:37:50", "text": "真痛苦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9473.83, "timestamp": "02:37:53", "text": "一遍又一遍。对，没错。如果什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9475.67, "timestamp": "02:37:55", "text": "喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9477.51, "timestamp": "02:37:57", "text": "如果我正在做一件重要的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9479.91, "timestamp": "02:37:59", "text": "如果真的非常重要，那就很重要了。"}]